      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah thats what i was thinking. it doesnt feel like an emergency or anything since i dont have any chest pressure or shortness of breath. i just feel a bit heavy in my jaw. so i could probably just take some ibuprofen and wait it out for a day or two to see if it's just muscle tension? i dont really want to go to a clinic if it's just stress or teeth stuff.",
